problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120636#issue-4743983171\r\n\r\n**Additional information**\r\n\r\nSummary of changes:\r\nAdded check for last_mouse_monitor_mask to prevent false popup menu closures after engine starts\r\n\r\nMotivation: gaining of practical experience\r\n[#120636](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120636#issuecomment-4820455994)\r\n\r\nRelated work: maybe GUI issue triage?\r\n\r\nTechnical overview: The integer last_mouse_monitor_mask is equal zero at the engine start so it always triggers \"if (mask != last_mouse_monitor_mask)\" at line 4844 until last_mouse_monitor_mask gets uptaded at line 4869.\r\nTo prevent this behavior I did add code that checks if last_mouse_monitor_mask equals zero, if so, it gets updated to prevent closing popup before it actualy has to.\r\n\r\nTesting:\r\nBefore fix: https://youtu.be/e50zRwaa2ro\r\n\r\nAfter fix: https://youtu.be/pTh8O7c3oLU\r\n\r\nDiscussion: I'm not exactly sure how much this small check will affect performace since method the fix is in is called very often. Maybe small refactoring will fix it, but only if this actually needed\r\n\r\nAdditional work: described feature in #120636 (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120636) doesn't work on wayland, surely it must be also fixed later\r\n\r\nEdit: Used DeepSeek to ask some uncertain things and asked it about some debugging tricks in VSC, AI wasn't fixing anything itself\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-28T12:58:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T19:00:33Z","closed_at":"2026-06-28T16:37:22Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"hea